# MacBook Pro, M1 Pro, 16 GB unified memory.
#
# Weights plus context have to fit in roughly 10-11 GB once macOS, Conductor
# and a browser have taken their share. qwen3.5:9b is ~7 GB on disk.
#
# CONTEXT starts at 32k on purpose. After the first run, check `ollama ps`:
# if the PROCESSOR column says "100% GPU", raise CONTEXT to 65536 and re-run
# ./install.sh m1pro-16gb. If it shows a CPU/GPU split, keep 32k or switch
# MODEL to FALLBACK_MODEL.
MODEL="qwen3.5:9b"
CONTEXT="262144"
KV_CACHE="q8_0"
FALLBACK_MODEL="qwen3:8b"
